This project reworks the author's earlier local Alexa history compatibility
implementation into an independent, generic Home Assistant integration.
Household commands and trial/measurement workflows are not included.

Interoperability and test dependencies (not vendored):
- Home Assistant Core 2026.10.2, Home Assistant contributors, Apache-2.0:
  https://github.com/home-assistant/core/tree/2026.10.2
- aioamazondevices 16.3.2, Simone Chemelli and contributors, Apache-2.0:
  https://github.com/chemelli74/aioamazondevices/tree/v16.3.2
Tests execute installed dependencies with synthetic records and identifiers;
no upstream parser excerpts or household recordings are redistributed.

Project icon supplied by the maintainer for this integration. The original
transparent PNG is preserved in assets/icon-original.png; brand/icon.png is a
size-only derivative. Product names and marks identify interoperability and
do not imply endorsement by Amazon or Home Assistant.
